This research result keeps the declared orthogonal Wilson spatial source,
its native charge frame, complete Gauss registers, literal finite photon
caps and full reference clocks. A compensated local creation/removal pump
has source-only success at least11/20. Complete bounded-time local records
converge when the observer stays inside growing open boxes and the static
reference root recedes. All pump failures remain in the observer law.

A complete local density detector has a positive original-attempt limiting
imbalance at least121/1600. Separately, subtracting the explicit reference
cost4 and Coulomb self-energy from the charged-minus-neutral **prepared
state** energy gives a root-independent limit, bounded below by
0.9864501953125m. This is not an interacting-ground energy difference,
charged pole, relativistic rest mass or Standard Model identification.

`PROOF.md` gives the three-dimensional centered Neumann heat estimate,
point-Green and dipole controls, complete histories, exact rank-one Wick
cancellation, reference-energy subtraction, finite-cap allowance and full
clock/capacity. `model.py` rebuilds actual source controls and exact finite
